  "author": "Seracha",
  "description": "The Changes I have made to the game myself are down below, anything not listed was done by SuperCrumpets so full credit goes to him for that.\n\nChanged Description - Admin Building\nChanged Admin Price to 150\nAdmins produce $75 every 90 seconds\nChanged Supply Depot Cost to $60\nChanged Starting amount of money in atomic mode to $1250\nChanged O-I Rocket Damage to 100 reload to 55\nChanged FCM Range to 130000\nChanged Jet Fighter and Jet Bomber production time to 25\nChanged Legonnaires to be researched at a price of $15 and a research time of 25\nChanged France Paratrooper cost to $15\nChanged All air recons move at an acceleration of 2500 except italy recon which is 2600 and the linear speed of all is 25000 except italy which is 26000\nChanged Air Recon from being reserearchable to base game\nChanged Admin strength to 3000\nChanged Blitz Ruse last 2:30\nChanged Fanaticism last 1:30\nChanged terror last 1:30\nChanged Radio Silence last 3:30\nChanged Camouflage net last 3:30\nChanged Inverted intel last 3:30\nChanged Spy to 1\nChanged Fake Units and Buildings to 7:30\nChanged AOV recon able to go in woods\nChanged Type88 Anti Air able to go in woods\nChanged AI Bonus Cash to 2000",
